title: "removeRole (stem-bot-v2: src/api/roles.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: discord_uid, discord_role_id = req.body
    q_validate --> q_err_input: !discord_uid or !discord_role_id
    q_validate --> q_fetch_member: getMember(discord_uid)
    q_err_input --> [*]: res.status(400)
    q_fetch_member --> q_err_member: member is null
    q_fetch_member --> q_remove_role: member found
    q_err_member --> [*]: res.status(404)
    q_remove_role --> q_err_role: removeRoleFromMember failed
    q_remove_role --> q_respond: role removed
    q_err_role --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success true)

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: No validation that discord_role_id belongs to a removable role
        INV-002: Any authenticated caller can remove ANY role from ANY member (no RBAC)
        INV-003: Could remove admin/privileged Discord roles via API
    end note
